{
  "bodyHash": "4b93f159bf501998",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Simple Hats 是一款可透過 JSON 設定的裝飾性帽子模組，允許玩家自定義帽子，並提供多種額外選項，如變體、染色、粒子效果與季節限定。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">模組預設包含近 300 頂自製帽子，玩家可以自由增減或變更。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/468/649/hats.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"1752\" height=\"945\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>其他功能：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 帽子可以從敵對生物掉落的隨機包中取得（右鍵開啟），也可以在各種戰利品箱子中找到。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 不需要的或重複的帽子可以回收，用來製作新的或升級的包，以獲得新或更稀有的帽子。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 帽子可以擺放在可製作的帽架上展示。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 部分帽子擁有可變換的模型/紋理，可在合成台中切換。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 部分帽子像普通皮革一樣可以染色，也可在鍋中洗掉顏色。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 部分帽子具有不同的粒子效果，可在第三人稱視角或觀察其他玩家時看到。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 此外，還有一個季節系統，在一年中的特定時間，普通包會掉落特殊隨機包。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>0.3.0 更新：</strong><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> &nbsp;&nbsp; 由 ArtsyDy 新增了超過 60 頂新帽子。警告：若您從舊版本更新，需要刪除並讓 simplehats.json 重新生成，才能獲得新帽子。</span></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/868/668/hatsnew2.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"1565\" height=\"618\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>0.2.0 更新：</strong><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> &nbsp;&nbsp; 由 StarArtsy 新增了超過 30 頂新帽子，其中包括 TwilightStar 為 Trinkets 和 Baubles 製作的泰迪熊帽子。</span><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/961/hatsnew.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"772\" height=\"523\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>特殊配方：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">根據稀有度回收不需要的帽子：</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/494/scrapcommon.PNG\" alt=\"帽子回收（依稀有度）\" width=\"300\" height=\"152\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">提升廢料稀有度或根據稀有度用廢料製作包包：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/493/scrapcrafting.PNG\" alt=\"廢料升級與包包製作（依稀有度）\" width=\"300\" height=\"322\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">給運氣不好的人（或非常特別的人 :) ）的預設可製作帽子：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/492/simplehat.PNG\" alt=\"預設可製作帽子（送給運氣不好的人 :) ）\" width=\"300\" height=\"151\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">切換帽子變體：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/491/variant.PNG\" alt=\"切換變體帽子\" width=\"300\" height=\"152\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">為帽子染色：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/490/dye.PNG\" alt=\"帽子染色\" width=\"300\" height=\"142\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>前置模組（Fabric/NeoForge 1.21.1 及以上）：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>必要：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Accessories：帽子透過 Accessories 進行裝備</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; owo-lib：負責處理 SimpleHats 的設定檔</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>前置模組（Forge 1.20.4 及以下）：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>必要：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Curios：帽子裝備於裝飾性 Curio 欄位中</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>選配：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; JEI：Simple Hats 支援相容於在 JEI 中添加自訂配方</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Optifine：若已安裝 Optifine，許多帽子將自動啟用自發光紋理（推薦）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>前置模組（Fabric 1.20.4 及以下）：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>必要：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Trinkets：帽子裝備於 Trinkets 的「帽子」欄位</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Cloth Config：用於非 JSON 的設定選項</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>選配：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Continuity 或 Optifine+Optifabric：若安裝任一模組，許多帽子將自動啟用自發光紋理（推薦）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Mod Menu：Simple Hats 與 Mod Menu 相容，讓玩家可在遊戲內存取設定</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>請記得將任何問題回報至頁面頂部連結的 GitHub 問題追蹤器！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>需要聯繫 Fonny？<span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\">（問題/錯誤回報）</span> 點擊下方徽章（Fonny / 程式設計 Discord）：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ZPdwrtvBKm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1202561752294760478?labelColor=violet&color=purple\" alt=\"\" width=\"183\" height=\"39\"></strong></span></a></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kfVjTWVz7N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>感謝您的捐贈，您將獲得獨特獎勵，包括專屬裝飾帽子！</strong></span><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kfVjTWVz7N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fstarartsy\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/starartsy</a></strong></span></span></span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fBSJ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/546e6fab-b6da-4f3f-b9ea-eaa0cdaffafe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"150\"></a></span></p>",
